Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Servicii IT și consultanță IT
ALTEN Romania is part of the ALTEN Group, Leader in IT and Engineering Consulting. We develop innovative and durable technical solutions that fulfill the needs of our local and international partners.
 As an Embedded Software Tester , you'll contribute to the verification and test activities for a Distributed Control Architecture (DCA) product in a safety-critical context for railway interlocking solutions. This is a great opportunity to work with highly reliable software in a multinational environment.
 A typical day might include the following: 
Specification of test cases based on requirements, including performance and boundary tests; 
Implementation of test cases for software-software and software-hardware integration tests; 
Test case design, test automation and test execution activities; 
Preparation of test campaigns with functional and non-regression tests; 
Detailed description of reproduction scenarios when identifying bugs; 
Evaluation of test outputs, including coverage, traceability and progress; 
Creation and maintenance of test documentation; 
Maintaining the test environment; 
Project monitoring activities, including monitoring non-conformities correction and test result reporting; 
Preparing hardware and software configurations for testing activities.
 To ensure success in this role, you need the following experience and skills: 
Studies in Computer Science or a similar technical domain;
Basic knowledge of Object-Oriented Programming (OOP);
Knowledge of computer networks and operating systems fundamentals;
Basic knowledge of Linux;
Commitment to the highest levels of quality;
Knowledge of version control systems (Git, ClearCase, etc.);
Experience with real-time or safety-critical systems;
Intercultural communication, including the empathy to work in an international team;
Team-working;
Good problem solving and diagnostic skills;
Solution oriented while being open to embrace new technologies;
Highly proficient in spoken and written English.
 Only eligible candidates will be contacted in a maximum of 2 weeks. Any information provided is treated as confidential.
